        "parms": "1. Click 127: bendout 0 bends up as far as the synthesizer allows, and 0 as far down. Click 64 to come back to rest. The message is 224 0 127: on the wire the fine byte comes first, and bendout leaves it at 0.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
      "object 16": {
        "ID": 16,
        "gui": {
          "x": "640.0",
          "y": "380.0",
          "w": "300"
        },
        "parms": "2. Drag the dial, or click 0, 0.5 or 1. It sends 0-16383, and xbendout sends every step, so a slow bend glides instead of moving in 128 steps. 0.5 is 8192, at rest: 224 0 64.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
